OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry start
OL,6,Ffor eastern areas. Rain across the
OL,7,Fwest pushes eastwards through the
OL,8,Fevening, falling as snow on hills.
OL,9,FStrong southeasterly winds with severe
OL,10,Fgales for a time over the Hebrides.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRain and hill snow to start.
OL,13,FThis clearing eastwards through the
OL,14,Fmorning, leading to bright spells and
OL,15,Fshowers during the afternoon. Winds
OL,16,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
